    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centiens</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centies</span></b> , adv.
		centum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a hundred times</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eadem imperare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 2, 4, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dictum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Heaut. 5, 1, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sestertium centiens et octogiens (sc. milia),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 35, 86</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circiter centies sestertium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nep.
					Att. 5, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
